  70+ 6538                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------
  71+ 6538                  ; Input: destra?
  72+ 6538                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------
  73+ 6538 CB 4A            bit  $01, d
  74+ 653A 20 3C            jr   nz, movePlayer_right
  75+ 653C
  76+ 653C                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------
  77+ 653C                  ; Input: sinistra?
